{
 "id": 1784077,
 "titulo": "2/27 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1677488427527,
 "modificada": 1740203401682,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1784077",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1642484088451\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb6d1abccb364a5981c9cb4a33768459_1642484088451_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We introduce the powerful telepath who is the head of the Quiet Council&nbsp;<br>\nand the pirate captain who leads the Marauders.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Professor X </span>is now prepared to lead the Quiet Council&nbsp;<br>\nwith his new Uniform and Tier-4 Advancement.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Kitty Pryde</span> will show abilities that fit the name of the Red Queen&nbsp;<br>\nwith her new Uniform and Tier-3 Advancement.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, check out their new skills and power<br>\nby downloading the 2/27 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">■ 2/27 Patch Details</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 2/28 (Tue) 3:00 (UTC+0), 2/27 (Mon) 19:00 (PST)&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">[2/28 (Tue) 3:00 (UTC+0), 2/27 (Mon) 19:00 (PST) added]</span></p>\n\n<p>The patch has been completed as of 2/28 (Tue) 2:56 (UTC+0), 2/27 (Mon) 18:56 (PST).&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances<br>\nand</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> the completion time will be announced</span></span></span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"> once the patch has been finished.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves and the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<strong><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Two New Uniforms</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The two new Uniforms Professor X &lt;Quiet Council&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nand Kitty Pryde &lt;Red Queen&gt; have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 2/27 Patch data is applied.<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats.<br>\n(Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6) &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1527\" id=\"1677474392186\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/fb37378ae91948639f894abe73278c20_1677474392186_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1428\" id=\"1677474392202\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/73915f9b737841bf9e6db9e7a36c918e_1677474392202_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Kitty Pryde Tier-3</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Kitty Pryde is now available for Tier-3&nbsp;Advancement.<br>\nThe Shadow Cat will cast sharp and precise attacks on her enemies.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"342\" id=\"1677474424554\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/d4c31b90c7834bbeaec0f870354f34b3_1677474424554_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1677474456683\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/eecddf78054c4b6d8dd37fdae8719ab7_1677474456683.gif\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Professor X Tier-4</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Professor X is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nXavier will strive to save the Mutants with his vast telepathic powers.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"275\" id=\"1677474490847\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/c61dd6e5862e44d3879f63965fcfa51b_1677474490847_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifacts</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">New Artifacts for Professor X and Kitty Pryde have been added.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"603\" id=\"1677474519705\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f8e99e2e67c34087b56c3715b94cacc3_1677474519705_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Other Improvements and Changes</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. &nbsp; New rewards will apply to the Store Loyalty Points&nbsp;<br>\nas of 2/28 (Tue) 15:00 (UTC+0), 2/28 (Tue) 7:00 (PST)<br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\">- Loyalty Points will still be reset on the last day of the month&nbsp;<br>\nat 15:00 (UTC+0), 7:00 (PST) regardless of the change.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"698\" id=\"1677474547609\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/be73d4fc30384027a1e5ee0ae9a49f40_1677474547609_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events<br>\nthat will be held to support the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" id=\"1677474303813\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/7139f3e9ad2e4b80b4d393c8bbeda7f2_1677474303813_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></p>\n"
